{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c3006289dd283e6894953c7a502d3a9f63d05230222f197e23e4c0626d261d34", "ja": "（今日はChrono-LexicaのPV撮影日。\n最初はみんな緊張してたけど、集中できてるみたいだ）", "zh": "（今天是Chrono-Lexica的PV拍摄日。虽然一开始大家都很紧张，但好像已经集中精神了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "55c7725eccf1906a2d96d36b301b45e2a7295089ff287e23c9f7a794cfae6ad0", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n……撮影、どうでしょうか。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n……拍摄进行得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9639d0877929b3fe08d5dd00d0acfc219be1b7d271d954b4eb649c70b144db78", "ja": "お疲れ様、瑞希。少し遅れてるけど、\nみんなの調子も戻ってきたし。大丈夫だと思うよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。虽然有点晚了，不过大家的状态也恢复过来了。我觉得应该没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "1d1cb3b88a9f0d9405bfbdf835c9b28684a712c4aec08fd752155a2df6fd5ace", "ja": "そうですか。それなら、よかったです。\nみんな、始まる前はちょっと元気がなかったので。", "zh": "这样啊。那就太好了。\n\n开始前，大家的状态都有点不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bb845da873a2c122d3b88c171b32ff883c2ad650cc4be052a1f46183d8ca5d50", "ja": "やっぱり、あの出来事が……？", "zh": "果然是因为那件事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "32f480d96864af3451e5c3c15354139fadd0f10c37d3aacdc53f1c068cb554bb", "ja": "はい。お化け屋敷より、リアルな体験でした。\n思い出すだけで、震えが。……ブルブル。", "zh": "是的。那是比鬼屋还要真实的体验。\n光是想起来，身体就会发抖……瑟瑟发抖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4727c6aa2ddae5ef48566f62887dd015ba3e6dd51d238cf90b69f9c0b1e1e80f", "ja": "それ、トラウマになりかけてるんじゃないか……？", "zh": "那不会是快要留下心理阴影了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "44437fa5dfc6cf3d793ed4165993cb958cc08a88c4caee55c10db5d022b00d8c", "ja": "そうかもしれません。人形を演じるシーンがあると\n知った時、みんな、青い顔をしていましたから。", "zh": "也许吧。得知有扮演人偶的场景时，大家的脸色都变得煞白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1008_p", "source_sha256": "793b7aaa9e4cc610223c9da7c599e98acc546f203e02d736b6413e96f55f8fb9", "ja": "みんな、小動物みたいに震えてたもんな。", "zh": "大家当时都像小动物一样瑟瑟发抖呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "c2d1cb4715799a65d8b3e4f7b8b52eedad9258fea18f6905059edd1c7ec695e3", "ja": "はい。ですが、私はお姉さんなので。\n……みんなを励ます役。", "zh": "是的。不过，我可是姐姐。\n……负责鼓励大家的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "cbe0f2dd24a3f78eae15de409868754f6d077446c8644c1e41711a1046862532", "ja": "あれが何だったのか、今でもわかりませんが……\n貴重な体験だったとも言えるのではないかと。", "zh": "那究竟是什么，我至今也并不明白……\n但或许也可以说，这是一次宝贵的体验吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "90db6b11e7caa1160475909be9fd0b38a71f0e163eb7a7a16039eaba017eab8d", "ja": "5人が同時に、同じ夢を見て、体験する。\nそんなことは、普通、ありえませんから。", "zh": "5个人同时做同一个梦，并亲身体验。\n这种事情，按理说是绝不可能发生的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b34c4f29137f14a49439f3a13753c1a4ef7a384426a1633fd65574a6b548fcb5", "ja": "そうだな。とにかく、みんなが無事でよかったよ。\nそんな大変な時に、付き添いできなくてごめんな。", "zh": "是啊。总之，大家都平安无事，真是太好了。\n在那么危急的时候没能陪在你们身边，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "9cb55b76de227395978d8c7d27d2997167a4648465901ff7b17674877704353b", "ja": "いいえ。あれはむしろ、{$P$}が\n傍にいなかったからこそ、起こった怪現象かと。", "zh": "不。我认为那反倒是因为{$P$}\n不在身边，才会引发的怪现象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "4c78624f4fa5d6e0602f481e55633303e5ae90678bdf344af44f4d540f5c8a17", "ja": "けど、もし{$P$}が一緒だったら……\n{$P$}も、人形になっていた……？", "zh": "可是，如果{$P$}也在一起的话……\n{$P$}也会变成人偶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bca24304272f796215fb13a3c75ce576dfeec0200a76f52b15fa04b4749e8db1", "ja": "えっ！？\nそれはない……と思いたいけど、どうだろう……。", "zh": "诶！？\n我希望不会那样……不过，谁知道呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "ba3c0638aa4ff4e0ae88c0805c2051bbde4a9a10aa77f98d6ddaa33186874119", "ja": "糸で操られる{$P$}……\nちょっと見てみたいぞ。", "zh": "被线操纵的{$P$}……\n我有点想看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0673_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "5feb8c02eb01ed528d27a37d67ed4e5e7d693c3bc9c5fd160ba70774bc301a71", "ja": "冗談はさておき。あの時、私が自分を信じられたのは、\nいつも私を信じてくれる人がいたからです。", "zh": "玩笑先放一边。那时之所以能相信自己，是因为一直有人相信着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
